   ("2. Social media handles", "Check Instagram, TikTok, X, LinkedIn and YouTube. Consistent handles make you easier to find."),
   ("3. Trademarks", "Search your country's trademark database (for example the USPTO in the US) for marks in your industry. A registered mark in your field is a reason to choose another name. This isn't legal advice; for anything uncertain, ask a trademark lawyer."),
